{"additions":2,"assignees":[],"author":{"is_bot":true,"login":"app/dependabot"},"body":"Bumps the cargo group with 1 update in the / directory: [rustls](https://github.com/rustls/rustls).\n\nUpdates `rustls` from 0.23.36 to 0.23.46\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rustls/rustls/commit/f04804fa13341a9b1dc02b5d1dd8a746f2c4b7fb\"><code>f04804f</code></a> Delay saving KX hint until handshake confirmation</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rustls/rustls/commit/049d39b975ef5c39f546a10fa03d420dcf053510\"><code>049d39b</code></a> Bump version to 0.23.46</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rustls/rustls/commit/6d0ba089d6d446959d113bdad43042780949ba48\"><code>6d0ba08</code></a> Eliminate secret from impl Debug for <code>ServerSessionValue</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rustls/rustls/commit/2b82b8141ae090fa193a9961705598b81d3aae9c\"><code>2b82b81</code></a> unbuffered: update TLS 1.3 traffic keys before exhausting them</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rustls/rustls/commit/74343e7047d7179b9bd7e67cef543b6c490518a1\"><code>74343e7</code></a> conn: update TLS 1.3 traffic keys within fragmented writes</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rustls/rustls/commit/795eea719e9491ee45aae38acc62a60a98969fbe\"><code>795eea7</code></a> Advance the HPKE sequence only after seal succeeds</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rustls/rustls/commit/d67cb716e6a086a9d88b69b966ab10c470087119\"><code>d67cb71</code></a> stream: provide backpressure while buffering received plaintext</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rustls/rustls/commit/7a69adee8fb37d17f1af241e44212bc83a911804\"><code>7a69ade</code></a> util: fuse flushes from connections with errors</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rustls/rustls/commit/493d08934775c115b2e6d6727789dd359850070b\"><code>493d089</code></a> conn: fuse writes for connections with errors</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rustls/rustls/commit/db00e0187de977ab6f1018d8158511ba4432c53c\"